  group_by(year) |> 
  summarize(number_of_articles = n(),
            average_sentiment = mean(ave_sentiment))
```

#My articles date back from 2015 to 2026. I chose 2022 as the cutoff year as it is in the middle.Thus, two new tables are created: 1) recent_news with 24 articles 2) older_news with 54 articles (51 articles are from 2021 only). AI was used here to figure out the filtering function.

```{r}
